OL,3,CHuman remains in river confirmed as
OL,4,Cmissing teenager Taylor Charlton
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall Police have
OL,7,Fconfirmed that human remains found in
OL,8,Fthe River Taw, near Sticklepath, are
OL,9,Fthose of teenager Taylor Charlton from
OL,10,FBarnstaple.
OL,12,FTaylor, 15, was last seen on the night
OL,13,Fof Friday 8 May, in Barnstaple, and
OL,14,Fthere has been an extensive operation
OL,15,Fto find him.
OL,17,FPolice recovered his body from the
OL,18,Friver on Wednesday 24 June.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
