OL,3,CHuman remains in river confirmed as
OL,4,Cmissing teenager Taylor Charlton
OL,6,FA 20-year-old man was detained on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder on Friday 12 June
OL,8,Fand later released on bail until
OL,9,FSeptember pending further enquiries.
OL,11,FPolice made the arrest at an address
OL,12,Fin the North Devon area after new
OL,13,Finformation was reported to them
OL,15,FOn Thursday 2 July, a woman in her 40s
OL,16,Fwas also arrested on suspicion of
OL,17,Fmurder but has since been released on
OL,18,Fbail pending further enquiries.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
