OL,3,CHuman remains in river confirmed as
OL,4,Cmissing teenager Taylor Charlton
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall Police have said
OL,7,Fthat the investigation into the
OL,8,Fcircumstances surrounding Taylor's
OL,9,Fdeath remains ongoing and detectives
OL,10,Fwill continue to establish the full
OL,11,Ffacts.
OL,13,F"Taylor's family have been updated of
OL,14,Fthis development and our thoughts and
OL,15,Fcondolences are with them, Taylor's
OL,16,Ffriends and the local community.
OL,18,F"Taylor's loved-ones continue to be
OL,19,Fsupported by specialist officers at
OL,20,Fthis incredibly difficult and
OL,21,Fdistressing time
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
